## Third-party code

`cardputer/patched-sources/main/` contains files from M5Stack's
**M5Cardputer-UserDemo**, modified by this project. They are redistributed under
their original MIT license and retain their original SPDX headers:

    SPDX-FileCopyrightText: 2025 M5Stack Technology CO LTD
    SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT

Upstream: https://github.com/m5stack/M5Cardputer-UserDemo
Base commit: b549eac

`cardputer/espnow-notify.patch` contains only the modifications made by this
project, expressed as a diff against that commit.

`bridge-esp32c5/apply_c5_patches.py` patches Espressif's `esp-now` component at
build time in a local checkout; it redistributes none of Espressif's code.
